flowchart TD
    Req[Brief Request] --> Key{Build Cache Key}
    Key -->|URL| URLKey[hash url + brief-type + model]
    Key -->|local PDF| PDFKey[hash path + mtime + brief-type + model]
    Key -->|YouTube| YTKey[hash video_id + brief-type + model]
    URLKey --> Lookup[(SQLite Lookup)]
    PDFKey --> Lookup
    YTKey --> Lookup
    Lookup --> Hit{Hit and not expired?}
    Hit -->|yes| Return[Return cached brief]
    Hit -->|no| Fetch[Extract and brief via LLM]
    Fetch --> Store[Store with TTL]
    Store --> Return
